# D-450-followup: raw multi-hundred-MB source dumps (Wiktionary/Wikipedia) are working material for the
# dictionaries/<lang>/ pipeline scripts, never committed - matches the existing convention for Wikipedia XML
# dumps (downloaded to a scratchpad, never checked in). dictionaries/sh/sh-extract.jsonl (277MB, the shared
# Croatian/Bosnian/Serbian Wiktionary source) is kept locally for now since kaikki.org marks it deprecated
# and it may become unavailable, but is deliberately excluded from git history for its size - re-download
# from https://kaikki.org/dictionary/Serbo-Croatian/kaikki.org-dictionary-SerboCroatian.jsonl if needed.
dictionaries/*/*.jsonl

# 2026-09-06: dictionaries/ru/bigram.tsv (141 MB) exceeds GitHub's 100 MB hard per-file push limit - Cyrillic's
# heavier UTF-8 byte-width roughly doubles this file's size versus a Latin-script bigram table of comparable
# row count. Kept locally only (regenerate from the Russian corpus pipeline if needed); the already-committed
# language-packs/adaptkey-lang-ru.zip ships the same data compressed (49.7 MB) and is unaffected.
dictionaries/ru/bigram.tsv
